@startuml
title BehaviorClassifier System Architecture

actor Operator

node "Video Source" as VideoSource
node "Object Detector\n(YOLO)" as YOLO
node "Tracker" as Tracker
node "TrackClipBuffer" as ClipBuffer
node "BehaviorClassifier\n(ViViT)" as Classifier
node "Alert Service\n(Spring Boot REST API)" as AlertService
database "Metadata Storage" as Metadata
database "Labeled Clips" as ClipsDB

VideoSource --> YOLO : video frames
YOLO --> Tracker : detected humans (bounding boxes + confidence)
Tracker --> ClipBuffer : track_id + frame crops
ClipBuffer --> Metadata : save metadata.json
ClipBuffer --> Classifier : buffered 16 frames
Classifier --> AlertService : alerts (REST API request)
Classifier --> ClipsDB : save classified clips

Operator --> ClipsDB : manual labeling
Operator --> Metadata : log labeling (CSV)

@enduml
